      "description": "Radiance: Stellar Glimmer: Increases CRIT DMG from Charged Attack condensed beams by 40%. Also, each time a beam is fired, CRIT DMG dealt by all condensed beams fired during this {LINK#N11330001}Decoding{/LINK} mode period will be further increased by 20%. Max 3 stacks."
